
4. Update the ECS Service

After enabling ECS Exec and updating IAM:

Go to ECS
Open your Cluster
Open the Service
Click Update
Go to Troubleshooting and enable EXEC. and redeploy
Enable Execute command
Deploy the service

Then force a new deployment so new tasks start with ECS Exec enabled.



aws ecs execute-command \
  --cluster testcluster \
  --task 63ebfb2f88dd49c2b0a4c9c401d23647 \
  --container prometheus \
  --interactive \
  --command "/bin/sh"



